Summarize today's inventory alerts.

Date: {{ $json.scanDate }}
Total SKUs scanned: {{ $json.totalSkus }}
Items needing attention: {{ $json.totalAlerts }}
Estimated reorder cost: {{ $json.currency }}{{ $json.totalReorderCost }}

Critical/out of stock ({{ $json.criticalItems.length }}):
{{ $json.criticalItems.map(i => `- ${i.productName} (SKU: ${i.sku}): ${i.currentStock} units left, ${i.daysOfStockLeft !== null ? i.daysOfStockLeft + 'd stock remaining' : 'no sales data'}, supplier: ${i.supplierName||'unknown'}`).join('\n') || 'none' }}

Reorder now ({{ $json.watchItems.filter(i => i.urgency === 'reorder_now').length }}):
{{ $json.alerts.filter(i => i.urgency === 'reorder_now').map(i => `- ${i.productName}: ${i.currentStock} units (reorder point: ${i.reorderPoint})`).join('\n') || 'none' }}

Give: what needs immediate action, any patterns across suppliers, one operational note.

